WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Xiao Zhang, you have hoarded a lot of supplies before

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,360
You should take the initiative to share the pressure

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:07,040
The warehouse supplies have been emptied long ago

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,360
My own rations are barely enough for a tiger's mouth

5
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,560
No more supplies than needed to be handed over

6
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:13,570
Holding three carts of supplies for the entire building

7
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,330
Don't force me to take someone with me

8
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:17,490
Refusal to cooperate is extremely selfish

9
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:20,030
The organization will never let you go

10
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:20,990
Whatever you want

11
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,550
Carrying a lot of supplies and pretending to be poor with me

12
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:26,110
Internally discounted goods, employee benefits received numerous benefits

13
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,550
How could there be a lack of food?

14
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,710
Auntie is an elder of the Giant Tail Society

15
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,470
Why don't you give me some packets of instant noodles first?

16
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,910
Set an example

17
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,830
You really don’t have enough food left at home

18
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,790
I'll communicate with you well

19
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:36,990
Don't be a bad person

20
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,590
This is a collective and unified arrangement

21
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,590
Failure to cooperate will only lead to corresponding consequences.

22
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,530
Just a temporary errand job

23
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:45,730
Also use the collective name to stake people's names

24
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,640
You're not even officially knitting.

25
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,920
Stop scaring people with empty words

26
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,600
The red old man and the old lady are fine.

27
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:53,470
Just pretend to be like me

28
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,640
If you want supplies, just come and wait at home.

29
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,600
That kid of yours is too much

30
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,720
Oppose me everywhere

31
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,990
There's no way to confront him now

32
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:04,990
First go to other residents’ homes to persuade them to get supplies.
